@startuml
actor User
participant "CLI/Desktop Entry" as App
participant "Main Log Parser" as MainParser
participant "Duty Log Parser" as DutyParser
participant "Event Matcher" as Matcher
participant "Excel Exporter" as Exporter

User -> App: Select files and start run
App -> MainParser: Parse Log A
MainParser --> App: Activity events + warnings
App -> DutyParser: Parse Log B
DutyParser --> App: Duty history + warnings
App -> Matcher: Match events per axis
Matcher --> App: Detail records
App -> Exporter: Write workbook
Exporter --> App: Output path
App --> User: Analysis summary
@enduml
